* opamp.lib -- 集成运放模型库
*
* UA741（μA741 通用运放）
*   来源：本项目自建的简化行为宏模型（单极点 + 输出限幅 + 压摆率），
*   参数按 μA741 数据手册典型值设定，未复制任何厂商 SPICE 模型文件。
*     开环增益 AVD = 200 V/mV；单位增益带宽 GBW ≈ 1 MHz（主极点 5 Hz）；
*     输入电阻 2 MΩ；输出电阻 75 Ω；压摆率 0.5 V/us；
*     输出摆幅 ±(VCC-1.5 V)；静态电流 ≈ 1.7 mA（±15 V 时，用 V+~V- 间电阻表示）。
*   结构：电路内部参考点取 (V+ + V-)/2，输出被钳在两电源轨之间，
*   因此电源未接时输出跟随内部参考点，不会产生放大。
*   许可证：随本项目发布，可自由再分发（项目自有内容）。
*
* 引脚顺序 = DIP-8：1 调零  2 IN-  3 IN+  4 V-  5 调零  6 OUT  7 V+  8 NC
.subckt UA741 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8
Rq 7 4 17.6k
Rnull1 1 4 1G
Rnull5 5 4 1G
Rnc 8 4 1G
Rin 3 2 2Meg
Bmid mid 0 V=(V(7)+V(4))/2
* 跨导级：gm = 1 mS，电流限幅 80 uA -> SR = 80u/159p ≈ 0.5 V/us
Bgm mid n1 I=80e-6*tanh(V(3,2)*1e-3/80e-6)
R1 n1 mid 200Meg
C1 n1 mid 159p
* 输出级：钳在 [V- + h, V+ - h]，h = min(1.5 V, (V+ - V-)/2)；未供电时 h = 0，输出 = 参考点
Bout o1 0 V=min(max(V(n1), V(4)+min(1.5,max(V(7,4),0)/2)), max(V(7)-min(1.5,max(V(7,4),0)/2), V(4)+min(1.5,max(V(7,4),0)/2)))
Rout o1 6 75
.ends UA741

* TLV9001_EST -- project-authored single-pole CMOS op-amp estimate, NOT a TI SPICE model.
*   Approved part reference: TI TLV9001IDBVR, ordinary DBV pinout, SBOS833R.
*   Pin order: OUT, V-, IN+, IN-, V+. Recommended supply 1.8..5.5 V.
*   AV=100000, input Rin=1T, output Rout=20 ohm and 1 mA linear-drive clamp
*   are conservative M0 modelling choices, not guaranteed datasheet specifications.
*   GBW=1 MHz, SR=2 V/us, input bias=5 pA, Ccm=5 pF/Cdiff=1.5 pF,
*   Iq=60 uA are datasheet typical references only. No max bias guarantee is claimed.
*   20 mV no-load rail headroom is an estimate; 5.5 V loaded swing test conditions
*   are not relabelled as a complete 5 V worst-case guarantee. No 8-ohm speaker drive.
*   Output rail diodes are numerical/protection estimates, not a characterized ESD model.
*   Input common-mode, overload recovery, temperature, protection and distortion
*   are not fully fitted. Use for the approved 0..3.333 V, <=250 uA follower load.
*   All active gain/drive stops below 1.8 V; the passive output then references V-.
*   Supply includes quiescent and delivered source current. Parameters do not
*   modify the original NE555 divider chain or UA741. Project-owned, redistributable.
*   Zero-ASRC implementation (2026-11-21 approved Option A): uses bundled compiled-C
*   analog.cm limit with native SPICE diode rail clamps and G/E/SW elements, preserving
*   all electrical specs (AV, GBW, SR, 20 mV rail headroom, 20 ohm / +-1 mA drive, <1.8 V off).
.subckt TLV9001_EST OUT VM IP IM VP
Rinp IP VM 1T
Rinm IM VM 1T
Cinp IP VM 5p
Cinm IM VM 5p
Cdiff IP IM 1.5p
Riq VP VM 83.333k
* gm/Rdom gives finite DC gain (AV=100000); gm/Cdom gives 1 MHz GBW; +-31.83uA bounds SR to 2 V/us.
Agm %vd(IP IM) %id(VM nd) TLV_GM_LIM
Rdom nd VM 1G
Cdom nd VM 15.9154943092p
* Native diode rail clamps keep nd within [VM+20m, VP-20m] at 5 V and auto-collapse to 0 when unpowered.
Evhi VP vhi VP VM 0.0050
Evlo vlo VM VP VM 0.0050
Dclp_hi nd vhi TLV_CLP
Dclp_lo vlo nd TLV_CLP
* 20 ohm (50 mS) linear drive stage clamped smoothly to +-1 mA, enabled only for V(VP,VM) >= 1.8 V.
Adrv %vd(out_int nd) %id(out_int VM) TLV_DRV_LIM
Rout_int out_int VM 1G
Spwr_drv out_int OUT VP VM TLV_DRV_EN_SW
* Passive recovery prevents an unpowered floating output becoming an ideal source.
Roff OUT VM 1G
Soff OUT VM VM VP TLV_OFF_SW
* Keep a source-stepping current load within the physical rails before the amplifier enables.
Dlow VM OUT TLV9001_RAIL_EST
Dhigh OUT VP TLV9001_RAIL_EST
.model TLV_CLP D(IS=1p N=0.01 RS=10)
.model TLV9001_RAIL_EST D(IS=1p RS=20 N=1)
.model TLV_DRV_EN_SW SW(VT=1.799 VH=1m RON=1m ROFF=1T)
.model TLV_OFF_SW SW(VT=-1.799 VH=1m RON=100k ROFF=1G)
.model TLV_GM_LIM limit(gain=100u out_lower_limit=-31.8309886184u out_upper_limit=31.8309886184u limit_range=5u)
.model TLV_DRV_LIM limit(gain=0.05 out_lower_limit=-1m out_upper_limit=1m limit_range=0.25m)
.ends TLV9001_EST
